SUMMARY:Vermont: BI-471 due
DESCRIPTION:Vermont business income tax return (covers partnerships and S-c
 orps) due the 15th day of the 3rd month after year-end (weekend-adjusted). 
 Extended due date is 30 days beyond the federal extended due date. | Vermon
 t business income tax return (covers partnerships and S-corps) due the 15th
  day of the 3rd month after year-end (weekend-adjusted). Extended due date 
