DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250416
SUMMARY:Kentucky: 765 (partnership) / 765-GP (general partnership) due
DESCRIPTION:Kentucky partnership income and LLET return due the 15th day of
  the 4th month after year-end. KY enacted a PTE elective tax effective for 
 tax years beginning 2026\, reported on this same Form 765/765-GP series. | 
 Kentucky partnership income and LLET return due the 15th day of the 4th mon
 th after year-end. KY enacted a PTE elective tax effective for tax years be
 ginning 2026\, reported on this same Form 765/765-GP series. File Form 720E
 XT or attach a copy of the federal extension to the return when filed\; ext
 ension is for filing only\, not payment. | Authority: Kentucky Department o
 f Revenue\, fetched this session (2018-edition instructions\; the 15th-day-
 of-4th-month rule is a long-standing statutory provision\, not year-specifi
 c): "A partnership return must be filed and payment must be made on or befo
 re the 15th day of the fourth month following the close of the taxable year
 " and "A six-month extension of time... may be obtained by filing Form 720E
 XT or attaching a copy of the federal extension." | Source: https://revenue
 .ky.gov/Forms/Instructions%20765%202018.pdf | This date is computed from a 
 recurrence rule and may not reflect a later-announced change\; confirm agai
 nst the cited source before relying on it.
